  <h1>Auto Screenshot Mode</h1>
  <p class="lede">Auto Screenshot Mode lets the board analyzer keep up with your game by itself. You connect the game's log and share the game window on this page. When the log shows a move, this page takes a picture of the game and hands it to the board analyzer open in another tab, which reads the board and updates the advice. Everything happens in your browser, on your PC. Below, this page says exactly what it reads and what it sees, with the code that does each part. The code is loaded from the same files your browser runs, so it can't differ from what's described here.</p>
