    <h2>In short</h2>
    <ul class="facts">
      <li><b>Nothing before you agree.</b> Until you agree at the bottom of this page, its controls stay hidden: nothing can open your log or see any window, and the board analyzer takes no pictures.</li>
      <li><b>One file, read only.</b> It reads the game log you drag onto this page or choose (<code>UE_game.log</code>), and only the lines the game writes after you connect it. It can't open any other file, and it never changes the log.</li>
      <li><b>One window, only with the log connected.</b> It takes pictures of the one window you share, never a whole screen or a browser tab, except in the desktop app when Windows won't share the game window and you allow it: then the screen the game is on, with each picture cut to the game window and taken only while the game is in front. It only does so while the game log is connected: when the log shows a move, or when you press Take a picture now, here or on the board analyzer (which asks this page to take it). Nothing is recorded in between.</li>
      <li><b>Pictures stay in your browser.</b> This page hands each picture to the board analyzer open in another tab, which reads the board from it with the screenshot reader. The picture passes between the two tabs inside your browser. Pictures are kept as small previews in memory and are gone when you close the tabs. Auto Screenshot Mode never uploads a picture or your log.</li>
      <li><b>Boards, only if you share boards.</b> The board the analyzer reads from each picture is treated like any board you ask about. If board sharing is on (the switch under the analyzer's ask button), the board is shared for the odds study: its cells, day and tools, with no picture and nothing about you. It's shared once the next picture comes in, so a board you fixed is shared as you fixed it. Turn that switch off and nothing is shared.</li>
      <li><b>In the desktop app.</b> Tartarus Overlay finds the log and the game window itself, with no picker, and keeps your last 5 runs' pictures, boards and advice on your PC to review. See <a href="#desktop">In the desktop app</a>.</li>
      <li><b>Off whenever you like.</b> Stop following and Stop sharing end it at once, as does your browser's own stop-sharing button. Turning it off at the bottom of this page stops it at once, and the analyzer stops taking pictures.</li>
    </ul>
====
    <h2>重點整理</h2>
    <ul class="facts">
      <li><b>同意之前什麼都不做。</b>在你於本頁最下方同意之前，控制項都是隱藏的：沒有東西能開啟你的紀錄檔或看到任何視窗，盤面分析器也不會截圖。</li>
      <li><b>只讀一個檔案，唯讀。</b>它只讀你拖到這個頁面或選擇的遊戲紀錄檔（<code>UE_game.log</code>），而且只讀你連接之後遊戲新寫入的內容。它無法開啟其他檔案，也絕不會修改紀錄檔。</li>
      <li><b>只看一個視窗，而且只在紀錄檔連接時。</b>它只擷取你分享的那一個視窗，絕不擷取整個螢幕或瀏覽器分頁；唯一的例外是在桌面版中，Windows 不肯分享遊戲視窗而你也允許時：這時會改用遊戲所在的螢幕，每張圖片都裁切成遊戲視窗的範圍，而且只在遊戲位於最前面時才截圖。它只在遊戲紀錄檔連接期間截圖：紀錄檔顯示有動作時，或你在這裡或盤面分析器上按下「立即截圖」時（分析器會請這個頁面截圖）。兩次截圖之間什麼都不記錄。</li>
      <li><b>圖片留在你的瀏覽器裡。</b>這個頁面把每張圖片交給另一個分頁裡的盤面分析器，由它用截圖辨識器讀出盤面。圖片只在你瀏覽器內的兩個分頁之間傳遞，以小型預覽圖保存在記憶體中，關掉分頁就消失。自動截圖模式絕不會上傳任何圖片或你的紀錄檔。</li>
      <li><b>盤面：只有在你分享盤面時才會分享。</b>分析器從每張圖片讀出的盤面，和你自己詢問的盤面一視同仁。如果盤面分享是開啟的（分析器「我該怎麼做？」按鈕下方的開關），盤面會分享給機率研究：只有格子、天數和刑具，沒有圖片，也沒有任何關於你的資訊。盤面會在下一張圖片進來時才分享，所以你修正過的盤面會以修正後的樣子分享。關掉那個開關就什麼都不分享。</li>
      <li><b>桌面版。</b>Tartarus Overlay 會自己找到紀錄檔和遊戲視窗，不需要你選擇，並把你最近 5 局的圖片、盤面和建議保存在你的電腦上供回顧。詳見<a href="#desktop">桌面版</a>。</li>
      <li><b>隨時可以關閉。</b>按「停止追蹤」和「停止分享」會立即結束，瀏覽器本身的停止分享按鈕也一樣。在本頁最下方關閉會立即停止，分析器也不再截圖。</li>
    </ul>
