    <h3>4. It watches for moves</h3>
    <p>The triggers are patterns for the lines the game writes when something happens. Each has a kind, the pattern, and a settle time. The built-in ones take a picture at: the run's objective popup; its pick of 3 instruments and each re-roll of it (also an extra pick an objective pays); the start of each day, once the new day's banner closes; after a move, when the cards come up; after an action in the cell, once it has played out; after each bite of a consume chain, and after a Cancel; after an event is confirmed (the Sewer Ratway's cell pick shows then); and the Warden's Treasure, and again once it closes. The Treasure covers the board, so the analyzer waits for it before advising a gift: press View Prison Status in the game, and the picture taken then is of the board behind the Treasure, which still waits; the gift advice uses that board. Two lines take no picture: the next day's banner cancels a picture still waiting, so an action that ends the day takes none of the banner; and the game's Speed-up button switches how soon pictures come. So it takes a picture of each screen where you decide something, and none in between. You can add triggers of your own at the top of this page, under Triggers and log lines; the built-in ones always apply as well.</p>
====
    <h3>4. 留意每個動作</h3>
    <p>觸發規則是比對遊戲在發生事情時寫出的紀錄行的規則，每條都有種類、比對規則和等待時間。內建規則會在以下時機截圖：這一局的目標彈窗；3 選 1 的刑具選擇與每次重骰（包括目標獎勵的額外選擇）；每天開始、新一天的橫幅關閉時；移動之後、卡片浮現時；在牢房中的行動演出完畢後；吞噬連鎖的每一口之後，以及按下取消之後；確認獄中事變之後（暗渠鼠道的選格畫面會在這時出現）；以及典獄長的珍藏出現時和關閉後。典獄長的珍藏會蓋住盤面，所以分析器會等拿到盤面後才建議珍品：在遊戲中按「查看監獄狀態」（View Prison Status），這時擷取的就是珍藏背後的盤面（珍藏仍在等你選），珍品建議就依據這個盤面。有兩種紀錄行不截圖：隔天的橫幅會取消還在等待的截圖，所以結束當天的行動不會拍到橫幅；遊戲的加速（Speed-up）按鈕則會切換截圖的快慢。因此它會在每個需要你做決定的畫面截圖，中間的過程一律不截。你可以在本頁上方的「觸發規則與紀錄行」中加入自己的規則；內建規則永遠同時適用。</p>
