    <p>Unlike the browser, the app keeps a record on your PC, so you can look back at a run from its tray menu (Review the record). It holds each picture the analyzer was handed, what the reader made of it, the board and the advice, and the changes you made on the board. It keeps your last 5 runs and deletes older ones. (A test build started with <code>--dev</code> keeps up to 1 GB instead.) The record stays in the app's folder on your PC and is never uploaded. Turn it off in the tray menu: Record every board and advice. The app also keeps a short log of what it did, such as the game starting and closing, pictures taken, readings and advice, for troubleshooting. That log never holds the game log's lines or a picture.</p>
====
    <h3>在你的電腦上保存最近幾局的紀錄</h3>
    <p>和瀏覽器不同，桌面程式會在你的電腦上保存紀錄，讓你從系統匣選單回顧某一局（回顧測試紀錄…）。紀錄包含交給分析器的每張圖片、辨識器讀出的結果、盤面和建議，以及你在盤面上做的修改。它會保留最近 5 局，刪除更早的紀錄。（用 <code>--dev</code> 啟動的測試版則改為最多保留 1 GB。）紀錄留在你電腦上的程式資料夾中，絕不會上傳。可以在系統匣選單中關閉：記錄每個盤面與建議（測試用）。程式也會保留一份簡短的運作紀錄，例如遊戲啟動和關閉、截圖、辨識和建議，用來排除問題。這份紀錄絕不包含遊戲紀錄檔的內容或任何圖片。</p>
